  "description": "Unified per-resource and host file logger for .NET Aspire AppHosts. Routes each ProjectResource / ExecutableResource console output to {resourceName}.log and every other category (Aspire.*, Microsoft.*, DCP, Dashboard, Default, ...) to apphost.log. Works in-process for both DistributedApplicationTestingBuilder integration tests and regular AppHost runs (aspire run / dotnet run), with no dependency on Aspire.Hosting.Testing.",
